# Exam Rubric

## Before scoring
Learning targets, levels, evidence, weights. No hidden criteria after seeing the answer.

## Score
Independent dimensions. One evidence quote each. Round once at the end.

## Integrity
- Collaboration = shared process, different product, can explain
- Plagiarism = stolen product (text/code/figure) presented as own
- LLM output they cannot defend = ghostwriting
Uncertain → flag + quote span, do not guess a penalty.

## Output
Targets → rubric → scores+evidence → total → integrity → keep/fix/next
